@base = http://localhost:5090

### Contract. The API commits this decision; workers perform the remaining work.
POST {{base}}/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{"subscriptionId":"S1","customerId":"C1","msisdn":"+34600000001","epoch":1,"profileId":"P1","initialAmount":25}

### Provider confirmation only agrees the window; it does not complete the port.
POST {{base}}/webhooks/mnp/confirmed
Content-Type: application/json

{"subscriptionId":"S1","msisdn":"+34600000001","epoch":1,"windowStart":"2026-10-26T02:00:00Z","windowEnd":"2026-10-26T04:00:00Z"}

### Provider completes the port.
POST {{base}}/webhooks/mnp/completed
Content-Type: application/json

{"subscriptionId":"S1","msisdn":"+34600000001","epoch":1}

### Independent probe confirms the current profile's connectivity.
POST {{base}}/webhooks/connectivity
Content-Type: application/json

{"subscriptionId":"S1","profileId":"P1","attempt":1}

### Customer view
GET {{base}}/subscriptions/S1

### Operational detail, payment/billing and process statuses
GET {{base}}/operations/S1

### Queue age/depth and dead letters
GET {{base}}/health/queue

### Incident queue
GET {{base}}/incidents

### A replacement attempt; only allowed before operational service
POST {{base}}/subscriptions/S1/profiles/P2/attempts/2

### Read-only payment reconciliation (does not initiate another charge)
POST {{base}}/subscriptions/S1/reconcile/1

### Cancellation request, never a fictional port rollback
POST {{base}}/subscriptions/S1/cancel-port

### Actual recorded replies for Urd, not reconstructed provider behavior
GET {{base}}/histories/profiles/S1/P1/1
